OP (permanently ENDS the episode \u2014 issue it only when you believe the robot is within 3 meters of the goal), 1 = move forward 0.25 m, 2 = turn left 15 degrees, 3 = turn right 15 degrees, 4 = tilt the camera up 30 degrees, 5 = tilt the camera down 30 degrees (tilt changes the camera pitch only, not your position or heading; pitch is clamped to \u00b160\u00b0).\n\nExecutes sequentially and halts early if the episode ends. Returns how many actions ran, total steps taken, remaining budget, and whether the episode is over. The camera view changes after stepping \u2014 call observe() to see the result.", "input_schema": {"properties": {"actions": {"items": {"type": "integer"}, "title": "Actions", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["actions"], "title": "stepArguments", "type": "object"}}], "effort": "medium", "options": {"argv": ["codex", "exec", "--json", "--skip-git-repo-check", "--sandbox", "read-only", "-c", "model = \"gpt-5.5\"", "-c", "model_reasoning_effort = \"medium\"", "-c", "model_reasoning_summary = \"detailed\"", "-c", "mcp_servers.env.command = \"/home/xukai/code/agentic-nav/MIP/envs/mip/bin/python\"", "-c", "mcp_servers.env.args = [\"/home/xukai/code/agentic-nav/MIP/exp_workspace/oracleES/mcp/bridge.py\"]", "-c", "mcp_servers.env.env = { BAREES_SERVER_URL = \"http://127.0.0.1:9200\", BAREES_TASK = \"nav\", BAREES_ACTIONS = \"6\", BAREES_STEP_BUDGET = \"500\", BAREES_TURN_BUDGET = \"0\", BAREES_BARE = \"1\", BAREES_AUTO_OBSERVE = \"0\", BAREES_LIVE_DIR = \"/home/xukai/code/agentic-nav/MIP/outputs/codex/test_r2r_es_codex_gpt-5.5_default_oracle-none/live_12\", BAREES_ORACLE = \"none\", BAREES_ORACLE_JSON = \"/home/xukai/code/agentic-nav/task3/oracle_by_index_rand100.json\", BAREES_ORACLE_MASK_FINAL = \"1\", BAREES_ORACLE_PARAMS = \"/home/xukai/code/agentic-nav/task3/rules_v0.json\", BAREES_EPISODE_INDEX = \"12\", EH_EXECUTOR = \"codex\" }", "-c", "mcp_servers.env.default_tools_approval_mode = \"approve\"", "-c", "project_doc_max_bytes = 0"], "sandbox": "read-